		(at 113.42 110 -90)
		(descr "Walsin RFANT5220110A0T multilayer ceramic chip antenna, 2.4GHz ISM band, body 5.2x2.0x1.15mm, 2-terminal SMD. Main lands per ASC_RFANT5220110A0T_V13: pad 2.0x1.0mm, pitch 5.4mm. Pad 1 = FEED. Pad 2 = open end with a 3.3x1.5mm axial copper plate and 0.5x1.2mm neck. This project-specific horizontal prototype uses 20.5x3.5mm all-layer clearance. Copper area is retained as a geometric starting point, not an RF-equivalent replacement. RF performance must be measured; the manufacturer reference uses a different end-copper geometry and 18x9mm clearance.")
